Package: gnome-terminal
Version: @DEB_GNOME-TERMINAL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Terminal
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libvte-2.91-0, libpcre2-8-0, gsettings-desktop-schemas, dconf, dbus
Description: GNOME terminal emulator (GTK3)
 GNOME Terminal is the GTK3 terminal for GNOME. The earliest-reachable GNOME app
 on this stack (GTK3 + VTE only). Runs as a plain X11 client under any WM.
